diff --git a/overrides/app/components/recommended-products/index.test.tsx b/overrides/app/components/recommended-products/index.test.tsx
index 29d2bcc..3d574c4 100644
--- a/overrides/app/components/recommended-products/index.test.tsx
+++ b/overrides/app/components/recommended-products/index.test.tsx
@@ -1,23 +1,19 @@
 /**
- * SFCC-83/84 build plan step A6 — asserts only this component's own branch-selection contract
+ * SFCC-83/84 build plan step E1 — asserts only this component's own branch-selection contract
  * (`.claude/rules/testing.md`'s no-duplicate-coverage rule): given a `recommender` and
- * `useRecentlyViewedHistory`'s return value, does it render `ZimmRecentlyViewedRail`,
